  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/897/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"93\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">战锤是 1.21 版本中引入的新武器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>现在，您可以通过制作战锤的不同变体来进一步增强原版游戏体验。请参阅下文了解您可以制作的物品。未来可能会添加更多变体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>钻石战锤</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：密度 II</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：2800</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特殊效果：主手持有时增加移动速度</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击伤害：6</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击速度：0.6</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/489/diamond-mace-recipe.png\" width=\"939\" height=\"353\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>烈焰战锤</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：火焰附加 II、亡灵杀手 I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：2000</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击伤害：6</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击速度：0.6</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/490/flame-mace-recipe.png\" width=\"936\" height=\"394\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px\"><strong><br>风之剑</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">附魔：旋风 II、锋利 I</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">耐久度：1700</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击伤害：12</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">攻击速度：1.6</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">纹理由 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/amadeusmc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Amadeus</a> 提供</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">注意：该物品在技术上仍然属于战锤，因此请使用基于战锤的附魔</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/896/492/wind-sword-recipe.png\" width=\"936\" height=\"358\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>您可以使用以下任意配方制作原版战锤：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/891/902/mace-vanilla-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"470\" height=\"645\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器并与朋友一起游玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a> 或下方横幅，并使用代码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
